class:: PhaserSVF

summary:: Cascaded allpass filters

categories:: UGens>Filters

DESCRIPTION::

Cascaded Allpass Filters. 100% Twang.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: ar

ARGUMENT:: input
Audio input signal

ARGUMENT:: freq
Allpass filter cutoff frequency in Hz (20-20000)

ARGUMENT:: resonance
Filter resonance (0-1). Higher values create steeper phase responses at the cutoff frequency

ARGUMENT:: feedback
Feedback amount (0-1). Higher values create more resonant peaks.

ARGUMENT:: mix
Dry/wet crossfade (0-1). 0 = completely dry, 1 = completely wet

returns:: Audio rate UGen.

EXAMPLES::

subsection::1.1) Phaser with Feedback

code::
(
{
	var sig = Saw.ar(32.midicps);
	PhaserSVF.ar(
		input: sig,
		freq: SinOsc.ar(0.3).linlin(-1, 1, 200, 4000),
		resonance: 0,
		feedback: 0.85,
		mix: 0.5
	)!2 * 0.1
}.play;
)
::

subsection::1.2) Modulating the Steepness of the Phase Response (Resonance)

code::
(
{
	var sig = Saw.ar(32.midicps * (2 ** TIRand.ar(-1, 1, Dust.ar(2))));
	PhaserSVF.ar(
		input: sig,
		freq: 500,
		resonance: SinOsc.ar(0.3).linlin(-1, 1, 0, 1),
		feedback: 0.85,
		mix: 0.5
	)!2 * 0.1
}.play;
)
::